<title>USA: TSI Telsys names new president.</title>
<headline>TSI Telsys names new president.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSI TelSys Corp said Thursday it has named Abdul Rahman Bin Abdullah president.</p>
<p>Abdullah succeeds Garry Bahsler, who has been appointed corporate secretary of the company.</p>
<p>Abdullah is the general manager of the technology division of Abrar Group International Sdn Bhd of Malaysia, a financial services company which is TSI's majority controlling shareholder.</p>
</text>
